{"mode":"words","text":"Siit edasi sõltub kõik sinu õppimiseesmärgist. Kui soovid keelt lihtsalt mõista, oled juba eesmärgi saavutanud – jää lihtsalt teise ja kolmanda sammu juurde. Kui soovid rääkida, tuleb kordamine kooris: võta A-B-kordamise abil lühike lause, sea kiirus väga aeglaseks ja räägi samaaegselt häälega kaasa – nagu kooris. Kuuled kohe, kui midagi kõlab teisiti, ja parandad end iseenesest. Seda saab teha kõikjal, isegi trammis: kõrvaklappidega kõlab see nagu telefonikõne. Ja kui tahad kirjutamist õppida, kirjuta tekst lihtsalt lausehaaval kaasa.","words":[{"s":0,"e":160},{"s":213,"e":560},{"s":600,"e":960},{"s":1000,"e":1200},{"s":1240,"e":1440},{"s":1520,"e":2720},{"s":3160,"e":3680},{"s":3733,"e":4080},{"s":4107,"e":4320},{"s":4373,"e":4800},{"s":4840,"e":5600},{"s":5640,"e":5840},{"s":5880,"e":6000},{"s":6040,"e":6480},{"s":6507,"e":7120},{"s":7400,"e":7680},{"s":7760,"e":7920},{"s":7973,"e":8400},{"s":8453,"e":8800},{"s":8880,"e":9040},{"s":9100,"e":9520},{"s":9560,"e":9840},{"s":9893,"e":10400},{"s":10920,"e":11520},{"s":11573,"e":11920},{"s":11960,"e":12720},{"s":12760,"e":13040},{"s":13080,"e":13520},{"s":13600,"e":14240},{"s":14480,"e":15120},{"s":15320,"e":16400},{"s":16453,"e":16640},{"s":16680,"e":17040},{"s":17093,"e":18080},{"s":18140,"e":18320},{"s":18400,"e":18880},{"s":18960,"e":19280},{"s":19360,"e":20240},{"s":20347,"e":20560},{"s":20600,"e":20880},{"s":20944,"e":21600},{"s":21640,"e":22000},{"s":22080,"e":22560},{"s":22760,"e":22960},{"s":23000,"e":23200},{"s":23240,"e":23760},{"s":24133,"e":25120},{"s":25173,"e":25440},{"s":25480,"e":25600},{"s":25640,"e":25920},{"s":25960,"e":26160},{"s":26213,"e":26800},{"s":26933,"e":27200},{"s":27240,"e":27680},{"s":27720,"e":27840},{"s":27893,"e":28720},{"s":29160,"e":29760},{"s":29787,"e":30000},{"s":30027,"e":30160},{"s":30200,"e":30960},{"s":31013,"e":31280},{"s":31333,"e":32000},{"s":32360,"e":33440},{"s":33480,"e":33760},{"s":33780,"e":33840},{"s":33880,"e":34080},{"s":34140,"e":34960},{"s